{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17900","headline":"酬张秘书因寄马赠诗 · 裴度","name":"酬张秘书因寄马赠诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满城驰逐皆求马，古寺闲行独与君。\n代步本慙非逸足，缘情何幸枉高文。\n若逢佳丽从将换，莫共驽骀角出羣。\n飞控着鞭能顾我，当时王粲亦从军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}